{"title":"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_11\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 11</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_11\">Problem 11</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 11\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/9735b37ac43861ef9e105bff1711f117917b09ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EFGH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> has one vertex on each side of square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />.  Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/4/134506cee7411dac7e90772b27d282fd1915d985.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE=7\\cdot EB$\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" />.  What is the ratio of the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/9735b37ac43861ef9e105bff1711f117917b09ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EFGH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> to the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/4/834025d32475e378c5cbf1d75b4cb573326d2e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\,\\frac{49}{64}     \\qquad\\text{(B)}\\,\\frac{25}{32}     \\qquad\\text{(C)}\\,\\frac78 \\qquad\\text{(D)}\\,\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{8}   \\qquad\\text{(E)}\\,\\frac{\\sqrt{14}}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"403\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the length of the sides of square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />. Then, the length of one of the sides of square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/9735b37ac43861ef9e105bff1711f117917b09ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EFGH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/e/95e04153068038d7ba5abf5445d67a66c0d2db9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{7^2+1^2}=\\sqrt{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"130\" height=\"21\" />, and hence the ratio in the areas is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/7/de7d809f18c3d37687f3e84ad9151a63a92d4e9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{50}^2}{8^2}=\\frac{50}{64} = \\boxed{\\frac{25}{32} \\ \\mathbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"185\" height=\"52\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GrCtzL0S-Uo?t=292\">https://youtu.be/GrCtzL0S-Uo?t=292</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A\">2011 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problem